<http://data.silknow.org/object/5964e065-00a8-330a-a05d-818ea3f26b70/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Robe, made of pink silk & cotton blend brocaded with silver-gilt thread, design of vertical stripes alternating with formal floral designs. Narrow band collar, edged with scalloping and gold braid down centre front, hem, and opening from the waist at centre back. Long sleeves designed to hang open if gilt buttons on forearms left unfastened. Lined with natural linen."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/5964e065-00a8-330a-a05d-818ea3f26b70> .

